# NOTE: the verified knowledge base (knowledge_base/laws/statutes.jsonl) and the
# generated evidence reports (benchmark/reports/, demo/reports_*) are intentionally
# tracked — they are the artifact, not build output.

# ---- Ephemeral SAMPLE-demo output (--offline demo / CI smoke; real reports are separate) ----
sample_demo_reports/

# project C demo artifacts (generated, not real rankings)
projects/instruction_following_bench/leaderboard.csv
projects/instruction_following_bench/leaderboard.html
# project C: held-out anti-gaming set — NEVER published (物理隔离于公开 tasks.json)
projects/instruction_following_bench/hidden_tasks.json

# project C: never commit real API keys (keep .env.example tracked)
projects/instruction_following_bench/.env
# project C: real model answer files (generated, not committed)
answers_ifb*.jsonl
# project C: difficulty-gate report is a GENERATED artifact keyed to a specific
# answers file (now carries a sha256 provenance header). A stale copy must never
# be committed as if authoritative, so it is git-ignored; regenerate after any
# answers change with `python -S difficulty_gate.py --answers <path>`.
projects/instruction_following_bench/difficulty_gate_report.md
# project C: local backup of original tasks.json (kept for rollback, not committed)
projects/instruction_following_bench/config/tasks.json.bak*
